              Generate Without Leaving Vinted
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              The AutoLister AI extension is built directly into the Vinted listing screen, so
              you skip prompt writing, copy-pasting, and tab switching. Upload
              photos, click once, review, then publish.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300"
          >
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
