              AutoLister AI detects your Vinted country and writes in the right
              language from your selected preferences, so sellers in FR, DE, NL, PL and other
              markets can post naturally without rewriting.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300"
          >
            <div
