                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3">
              Start Free, Upgrade Only When You Need Volume
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              New sellers can test with {freePricingCopy}, then move to
              higher limits only when sales activity increases. It is easy to
              start without commitment.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300"
          >
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3">
              Built for Casual Sellers and Resellers
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              Whether you are clearing your wardrobe or running a side hustle,
              AutoLister AI gives consistent listing quality at scale so you can
              publish more items each week.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300"
          >
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3">
              Control Brand Voice on Pro and Business
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              Advanced plans unlock tone selection and emoji toggles, so power
              sellers can match their preferred style while keeping descriptions
              clear and conversion-focused.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
