          >
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3">
              Phone Upload for Your Desktop Listing Workflow
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              Snap photos on your phone, upload them to your current listing
              session, then generate the description from those images on
              desktop. This connects phone photos to the desktop extension.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 sm:col-span-2"
          >
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-3">
              Batch Drafts for Multiple Items
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              When you have several item photo sets ready, batch generation helps create
              multiple Vinted drafts faster. It is still a review-first workflow: check
              size, condition, price, and flaws before publishing.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How It Compares to Using ChatGPT Directly -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">
          AutoLister AI vs. Using ChatGPT for Vinted Descriptions
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10">
          Both tools can draft descriptions from photos. This table compares the
          AutoLister browser extension with manually writing a description in
          ChatGPT. The AutoLister web app uses a separate upload-and-copy workflow.
        </p>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200">
          <table class="w-full text-sm text-left">
            <thead class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200">
              <tr>
                <th class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-slate-700 w-2/5"
